    "description": "Gaurs Group Advisory Limited has an exciting opening for a Sales Manager at our Raipur office. Join a company that values innovation, collaboration, and continuous learning.\n\nAbout Gaurs Group Advisory Limited:\nGaurs Group Advisory Limited is a leading organization in the Remote sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Provide advisory services on property investment and market trends\n• Build relationships with channel partners and brokers\n• Maintain a pipeline of qualified leads using CRM software\n• Source and close property deals with prospective buyers and investors\n• Achieve monthly and quarterly sales targets\n• Conduct site visits and property presentations for clients\n• Conduct land acquisition due diligence and feasibility studies\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• B.Tech / B.E. in Computer Science or related discipline\n• 10-15 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in MS Office\n• Proficiency in AutoCAD\n• Proficiency in Portfolio Management\n• Proficiency in Investment Analysis\n• Proficiency in Financial Modeling\n• Proficiency in CRM Software\n• Proficiency in RERA Compliance\n• Proficiency in Real Estate Law\n\nWork Mode: Remote - Work from anywhere in India\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Annual paid leaves and casual leaves\n• Provident Fund and Gratuity as per company policy\n• Comprehensive health insurance for self and family\n• International travel opportunities for senior roles\n• Annual performance appraisal\n• Work-from-home flexibility\n• Salary Range: 20 LPA - 40 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Raipur, Chhattisgarh, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Gaurs Group Advisory Limited!",
